  "title": "Himalaya Shipping Ltd. (HSHP) – Commercial Update and Key Information Relating to the Cash Distribution for May 2026",
  "summary": "Hamilton, Bermuda, June 9, 2026 Commercial update: In May 2026, Himalaya Shipping Ltd. (“Himalaya,” or the “Company”) achieved average time charter equivalent (“TCE”) earnings of approximately US$57,200 per day, gross[1], including average daily scrubber benefits of approximately US$1,300 per day. The Company’s eleven vessels trading on index-linked time charters earned approximately US$59,600 per day, gross, […]",
